---
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['file-diagram', 'dual-path-diagram', { compact }]} role="img" aria-label="Upcoming network architecture. File path: sensitive file, fragment, encrypt fragments, distribute protected fragments across logical storage locations. Separate key path: cryptographic material, fragment or shred cryptographic material, protect multiple key components through the HSM architecture. Both paths converge only at authorized Cyber Reliant reconstruction to produce a readable file. Logical locations do not necessarily represent physically independent failure domains; component counts are illustrative.">
  <div class="diagram-top"><span><i class="status-dot"></i> UPCOMING NETWORK ARCHITECTURE</span><span>FIG. 01</span></div>
  <div class="network-paths">
    <div class="network-lane file-lane">
      <span class="path-heading">FILE PATH</span>
      <div class="path-origin"><svg width="27" height="30" viewBox="0 0 44 52" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2h19l12 12v36H8zM27 2v13h12M15 25h17M15 32h17M15 39h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg><strong>Sensitive file</strong></div>
      <span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <div class="path-node"><span class="path-step">01</span><strong>Fragment</strong><div class="path-pieces" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
      <span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <div class="path-node"><span class="path-step">02</span><strong>Encrypt fragments</strong><div class="path-cipher" aria-hidden="true"><span>A7</span><span>F2</span><span>9C</span></div></div>
      <span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <div class="path-node path-storage"><span class="path-step">03</span><strong>Distribute</strong><div class="logical-stores" aria-hidden="true">{['A','B','C'].map(letter=><span><i></i>{letter}</span>)}</div><small>Protected fragments across<br/>logical storage locations</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="network-lane key-lane">
      <span class="path-heading">KEY PATH</span>
      <div class="path-origin"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="11" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="m14 15 12 12m-4-4 4-4m-8 0 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg><strong>Cryptographic material</strong></div>
      <span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <div class="path-node"><span class="path-step">01</span><strong>Fragment / shred</strong><small>Cryptographic material itself</small><div class="key-shreds" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
      <span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <div class="path-node hsm-components"><span class="path-step">02</span><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="24" height="24" stroke="currentColor"/><path d="M14 2v6m12-6v6M14 32v6m12-6v6M2 14h6m-6 12h6m24-12h6m-6 12h6" stroke="currentColor"/></svg><strong>Protect multiple<br/>key components</strong><div class="key-components" aria-hidden="true"><span>◇</span><span>◇</span><span>◇</span></div><small>Through the HSM architecture</small></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="reconstruction-convergence">
    <svg class="convergence-lines" viewBox="0 0 600 45" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M150 0V44M450 0V44" fill="none" stroke="#809b76" stroke-width="1"/><path class="flow-line" d="M150 0V44M450 0V44" fill="none" stroke="#d3ef74" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 55"/></svg>
    <div class="reconstruction-gate"><span>AUTHORIZED CYBER RELIANT</span><strong>RECONSTRUCTION</strong><small>Required fragments + protected cryptographic material</small></div>
    <div class="readable-output"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span><strong>Readable file</strong></div>
  </div>
  <p class="diagram-caption">Conceptual architecture · Component counts illustrative<br/>Logical separation does not imply physical independence.</p>
</div>
